            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Diana R"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Wonderful. I used white flour, 'cause that's all I had, and added 1/4 tsp nutmeg. Skipped the sugar,and added 1/2 chopped fresh apple. Moist, delicious. Terrific!",
            "datePublished": "2007-10-14T11:32:59.080Z"
          },
          {
