            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Crin"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I can see how people think this is a bland recipe, BUT if you serve them as 'pancakes' they would be wonderful with maple syrup. Making them as thin as possible will definitely help with the blandness problem as well. For the kids or even themed parties, try placing a cookie cutter on your griddle and pour your batter into that to get cute shaped cakes! :)",
            "datePublished": "2008-04-12T15:06:16.050Z"
          },
          {
