            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kristal R"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Pretty good start, but yes a little bland like others said. It just needs some more cinnamon. I would suggest more sugar in the form of Splenda, but the pancakes are fine when you add syrup. Mine out turned thick as well, so I added about some milk until I got the consistency I wanted, probably 6T.",
            "datePublished": "2010-08-29T02:09:05.540Z"
