              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "OCEANVIXEN79"
            },
            "reviewBody": "5 stars for delicious and nutritious. The only thing I changed was to add a chopped Granny Smith apple. My husband took a bite and gave me a suspicious look until I explained they they were healthy and had whole wheat flour and no oil in them. So he's been munching on them all morning.",
            "datePublished": "2007-03-18T09:41:54.297Z"
